WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.550
A long-nosed pirate proudly enters a prompt into his phone.

2
00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.350
He makes a completely impossible claim beside a suspicious printing machine.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.800
The machine feeds a storm of pages into his arms.

4
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:03.700
The pages become a cannon-sized book and crash across the print shop.

5
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:04.350
He proudly presents the newly published story, struggling under its weight.

6
00:00:04.350 --> 00:00:05.800
The liar poses with his enormous book. The lie now has a publication date.
